        "@value": "This concerns data that are specific to the Observation and complementary to the description of the procedure followed during the Observation (analysis method and aloke, see Process class), which in itself says something about the quality of the result."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The extent to which the result of the Observation meets the requirements or expectatrions."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "resultQuality"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso": [
      {
        "@id": "https://data.dev-vlaanderen.be/doc/applicatieprofiel/AirAndWater/Core/ontwerpstandaard/toolchain4#Observation.Resultquality"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class": [
      {
        "@id": "http://def.isotc211.org/iso19115/2006/DataQualityInformation#DQ_Element"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The extent to which the result of the Observation meets the requirements or expectatrions."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "resultQuality"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path": [
      {
        "@id": "http://def.isotc211.org/iso19156/2011/Observation#OM_Observation.resultQuality"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:df_8_19",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#PropertyShape"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This is not about properties of the featureOfInterest (these are already described by the observedProperty) or parameters associated with the observation process (like an instrument setting). This is rather about, for example, environmental parameters that can influence the result and are important for correctly interpreting the result. An example is the depth in a well at which the water quality was measured or the ambient temperature when humidity was measured."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any data related to the Observation as an activity."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "parameter"
      }
    ],
